  "title": "8D8's Briefing",
  "description": "Outside the palace, a B'omarr monk spider scuttles by. Inside, 808 continues to prove useful in his new role. The Droid lays out the status of the city of Mos Espa since the death of Jabba the Hutt, and also to a lesser degree, of Bib Fortuna. Since Jabba, many groups and gangs have moved in and cut up the territory once belonging to the vile Hutt. Unprepared for the arrival of Boba Fett, those same organizations wait to see how Fett will lead."
